<h4 data-number="5.6.6.3" id="ctxtypertgateway--typertgatewayservice"><span class="header-section-number">5.6.6.3</span>
<code>ctx.typertGateway</code> — <code>TypertGatewayService</code></h4>
<p>Resolve strict generated definitions or conservative SRC markers
against current Cordis Services and Typert providers.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb187"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb187-1"><a href="#cb187-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
