<span id="cb187-3"><a href="#cb187-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">request</span><span class="co"> - decoded endpoint and exact named wire arguments.</span></span>
<span id="cb187-4"><a href="#cb187-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> the validated business result.</span></span>
<span id="cb187-5"><a href="#cb187-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@throws</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">{@link</span><span class="co"> TypertGatewayError} for dispatch, provider, or boundary failures; lookup-policy and business errors retain identity.</span></span>
