<h4 data-number="5.17.5.1" id="ctxfilereferences--filereferenceservice-abstract-seam"><span class="header-section-number">5.17.5.1</span>
<code>ctx.fileReferences</code> — <code>FileReferenceService</code>
(abstract seam)</h4>
<p>Host capability for cancellable file-reference discovery.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb337"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb337-1"><a href="#cb337-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
