<h2 data-number="5.28" id="扩展"><span class="header-section-number">5.28</span> 扩展</h2>
<p>extensions 子系统允许 agent（智能体）定义带版本的 Cordis 包、运行其
host
与浏览器两半，并在编写代码前查询获准公开的运行时元数据。包生命周期与沙箱行为由
<a href="https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness/blob/master/packages/extensions/README.md"><code>packages/extensions</code></a>
包组说明。</p>
<!-- BEGIN GENERATED cordis-surface (gen-cordis-catalog.ts) — do not edit between markers -->

