<span id="cb450-114"><a href="#cb450-114" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">agent</span><span class="co"> - Agent whose Session selects visible Plugins.</span></span>
<span id="cb450-115"><a href="#cb450-115" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> Plugin versions, active runs, Host fibers, and render failures.</span></span>
