<span id="cb450-128"><a href="#cb450-128" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * List source-free Plugin summaries owned by one Session.</span></span>
<span id="cb450-129"><a href="#cb450-129" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">agent</span><span class="co"> - Agent whose Session selects visible Plugins.</span></span>
<span id="cb450-130"><a href="#cb450-130" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> one summary per Plugin in creation order.</span></span>
