<span id="cb450-137"><a href="#cb450-137" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">pluginId</span><span class="co"> - stable Plugin identity.</span></span>
<span id="cb450-138"><a href="#cb450-138" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> version pointers, latest run, and all Package summaries.</span></span>
