<span id="cb450-146"><a href="#cb450-146" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">packageId</span><span class="co"> - Exact immutable Package identity to inspect.</span></span>
<span id="cb450-147"><a href="#cb450-147" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> Package metadata, source, and the Plugin&#39;s lifecycle pointers.</span></span>
