<p><a id="cordisdynamic-package--emit"></a></p>
<h5 data-number="5.28.1.3.1" id="cordisdynamic-package--emit"><span class="header-section-number">5.28.1.3.1</span>
<code>cordis/dynamic-package</code> — emit</h5>
<p>One exact Plugin/Package activation is now live in the Host.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb451"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb451-1"><a href="#cb451-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
