<code>cordis/dynamic-retract</code> — emit</h5>
<p>One exact activation was withdrawn.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb452"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb452-1"><a href="#cb452-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
<span id="cb452-2"><a href="#cb452-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * One exact activation was withdrawn.</span></span>
<span id="cb452-3"><a href="#cb452-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">retracted</span><span class="co"> - plugin, package, and run identity.</span></span>
