<p><a id="cordisinspect-query--emit"></a></p>
<h5 data-number="5.28.1.3.3" id="cordisinspect-query--emit"><span class="header-section-number">5.28.1.3.3</span>
<code>cordis/inspect-query</code> — emit</h5>
<p>Request a live read-only query from the Client inspect registry.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb453"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb453-1"><a href="#cb453-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
