<p><a id="skills-events"></a></p>
<h4 data-number="5.31.7.2" id="skills-events"><span class="header-section-number">5.31.7.2</span> <code>skills/*</code>
events</h4>
<p><a id="skillschange--emit"></a></p>
<h5 data-number="5.31.7.2.1" id="skillschange--emit"><span class="header-section-number">5.31.7.2.1</span>
<code>skills/change</code> — emit</h5>
<p>A skill provider, runtime contribution, or provider-backed catalog
may have changed. This is an unfiltered invalidation notification;
consumers refetch the catalog for their own lookup options. Listener
failures are contained and cannot veto the registry mutation.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb501"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb501-1"><a href="#cb501-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
<span id="cb501-2"><a href="#cb501-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * A skill provider, runtime contribution, or provider-backed catalog may</span></span>
<span id="cb501-3"><a href="#cb501-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * have changed. This is an unfiltered invalidation notification; consumers</span></span>
<span id="cb501-4"><a href="#cb501-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * refetch the catalog for their own lookup options. Listener failures are</span></span>
<span id="cb501-5"><a href="#cb501-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * contained and cannot veto the registry mutation.</span></span>
<span id="cb501-6"><a href="#cb501-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@mode</span><span class="co"> emit</span></span>
<span id="cb501-7"><a href="#cb501-7" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> */</span></span>
<span id="cb501-8"><a href="#cb501-8" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="st">&#39;skills/change&#39;</span>()<span class="op">:</span> <span class="dt">void</span></span></code></pre></div>
