<h4 data-number="5.34.5.1" id="ctxagentteams--teamservice"><span class="header-section-number">5.34.5.1</span>
<code>ctx.agentTeams</code> — <code>TeamService</code></h4>
<p>Agent Teams service backed by the exact live Lead Session log.</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb537"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb537-1"><a href="#cb537-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
