<span id="cb537-42"><a href="#cb537-42" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">id</span><span class="co"> - Team-local task identity.</span></span>
<span id="cb537-43"><a href="#cb537-43" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> the latest task value and derived readiness diagnostics.</span></span>
<span id="cb537-44"><a href="#cb537-44" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> */</span></span>
