about to execute. Paired with Events[&#39;workflow/end&#39;].</p>
<div class="sourceCode" id="cb561"><pre class="sourceCode ts"><code class="sourceCode typescript"><span id="cb561-1"><a href="#cb561-1" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co">/**</span></span>
<span id="cb561-2"><a href="#cb561-2" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * A workflow run started — the script&#39;s meta block validated, the body</span></span>
<span id="cb561-3"><a href="#cb561-3" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * about to execute. Paired with {</span><span class="an">@link</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">Events</span><span class="co">[&#39;workflow/end&#39;]}.</span></span>
<span id="cb561-4"><a href="#cb561-4" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">info</span><span class="co"> - the run&#39;s identity snapshot (id + meta).</span></span>
<span id="cb561-5"><a href="#cb561-5" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@mode</span><span class="co"> emit</span></span>
<span id="cb561-6"><a href="#cb561-6" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> */</span></span>
