<span id="cb572-39"><a href="#cb572-39" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@param</span><span class="co"> </span><span class="cv">name</span><span class="co"> - the preset to switch to; unknown names throw.</span></span>
