<span id="cb595-62"><a href="#cb595-62" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> * </span><span class="an">@returns</span><span class="co"> the workspace owning the canonical path, when one exists.</span></span>
<span id="cb595-63"><a href="#cb595-63" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1"></a><span class="co"> */</span></span>
